id: big-bubble
name: Big Bubble
advancement: true
prerequisite: 3+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic
tpCost: 5
# "You may apply the effects of this Unique Ability within a Sphere AoE" - a Standard one, no Magnitude named - "For
# every Skill Rank in Use Magic you possess past the second, you can increase the Ki Point Cost of this Unique
# Ability by 2(T) to increase the Magnitude of this Sphere AoE by 1 Magnitude." Asked when it is used; the
# Sphere is said on the card and who is inside it is the table's (the user's ruling).
sphere: true
sphereStepKiPerTier: 2
sphereStepsSkill: useMagic
sphereStepsPast: 2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Applied within a Sphere AoE, 1 Magnitude larger for 2(T) KP per Use Magic Rank past the second.
text: >
  Big Bubble: You are able to create a larger bubble to protect others besides yourself.
  –Prerequisites: 3+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic
  –TP Cost: 5
  –Effect: When using this Unique Ability, you may apply the effects of this Unique Ability within a Sphere AoE. For
  every Skill Rank in Use Magic you possess past the second, you can increase the Ki Point Cost of this Unique
  Ability by 2(T) to increase the Magnitude of this Sphere AoE by 1 Magnitude.
